  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2017-2021 Nissan Titan\n2016-2021 Nissan Titan XD Crew Cab\nfor With 1st Row Bucket Seats & Rear Under Seat Organizer\nfor Carpet flooring\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCUSTOM FIT: These floor mats are compatible with 2017-2021 Nissan Titan/ 2016-2020 Nissan Titan XD Crew Cab with 1st row bucket seats & rear seat cargo organizer, and for carpet flooring only, not for King Cab and vehicles with vinyl floors. 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back. Please remove old floor mats before installing new ones.\nSAFE & DURABLE: YITAMOTOR floor liners are made with non-toxic and odorless TPE material, ensuring 100% safety even in extreme hot weather. The product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC’s. High tensity TPE material not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear-resistance, but also remains flexible in even the harshest of cold weather.\nALL WEATHER PROTECTION & NON-SLIPPERY: The unique designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquids, snow, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean. Even in wet conditions, the hooks can effectively prevent the mats from slipping. The mats are available for children and the elderly.\nEASY TO CLEAN: The textured skid-resistant surface is easily cleaned. Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose.",
  "highlights": [
    "They securely attach to your vehicle using the original factory clasps, keeping the floor liners firmly in place and preventing unwanted shifting during daily driving.",
    "The raised edges provide maximum vehicle coverage, Floor Liners accurately and completely line the vehicle carpet giving absolute interior protection.",
    "Specially designed channels ensure the liner effectively contain the liquid to keep your vehicle and shoes clean, non-slip design for safe driving."
  ],
